# Owners of the normative surface: the rule set and the schema bundle.
# GitHub requests a review from the owner on every pull request that
# touches these paths.
#
# This file records ownership. It does not by itself require an approval:
# that needs a branch protection rule on `main` with "Require review from
# Code Owners" enabled. While the repository has one maintainer, who also
# opens the automation-authored pull requests, GitHub would leave such a
# rule unsatisfiable, so it stays off. CONTRIBUTING.md, "Review", states
# what to enable once a second reviewer can approve.

/yaml/rules/        @elong0527
/yaml/schema*.yaml  @elong0527

# The governance machinery itself.
/.github/CODEOWNERS @elong0527
/CONTRIBUTING.md    @elong0527
/CHANGELOG.md       @elong0527
/changelog.d/       @elong0527
